{
  "$comment": "Terraform resource type -> diagrams-js node id (provider/category/Name). Verified against the pinned diagrams-js by tests/mappings.test.ts. 'cluster' rows become clusters. 'edges' rows are resources that only express a relationship. 'hidden' prefixes are omitted unless the request asks for them.",
